      "Puppy runs a marathon",
      "",
      "In America, there is an extremely cute little dog who finished a marathon together with everyone.",
      "",
      "One Saturday morning, the little dog was outside playing.",
      "Unexpectedly there was a marathon right there, and the little dog ran up to the start line.",
      "And 1, 2, 3, he took off together with everyone else!",
      "",
      "Some people witnessed that the puppy stopped a few times to play, and they thought maybe it would not run anymore.",
      "But in the end, the little dog still ran all the way to the finish line, and came in at 7th place."
